<!DOCTYPE html>
<style>
    .flowchart {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .step, .decision {
        border: 1px solid #000;
        padding: 10px;
        margin: 10px;
        text-align: center;
        width: 200px;
        position: relative;
    }

    .step {
        background-color: #d1e7dd;
    }

    .decision {
        background-color: #fff3cd;
        width: 220px;
        transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    .decision div {
        transform: rotate(-45deg);
        width: 100%;
    }

    .connector {
        width: 2px;
        height: 40px;
        background-color: #000;
        margin: -10px 0;
    }

    .horizontal {
        width: 60px;
        height: 2px;
        background-color: #000;
    }

    .label {
        position: absolute;
        top: -25px;
        font-weight: bold;
        background-color: #fff;
    }
</style>
<body>
<div class="flowchart">

    <div class="step">
        1 - Scope
        <br>
        Each engagement starts with a Scope of Work (SOW)—a shared under-standing of what we’re solving.
    </div>
